                                "sense_id": "f814855c-55ab-3fab-9116-8d7c2bcd78a8",
                                "text": "Her house was a little grey fibro job. Nondescript really, with cracked and broken fibro louvres, sad and sorry walls."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e4a971e6-92b9-47b9-bc6f-a14a12bbe6b1",
                                "sense_id": "f814855c-55ab-3fab-9116-8d7c2bcd78a8",
                                "text": "There are a few faded colourless fibro buildings, jagged black holes punched here and there in the panels."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "12bbca43-1c5e-3055-973f-09bdbad3a6e4",
                        "entry_id": "8b0441ba-c40e-3b7b-8423-a5dc9b3dd013",
                        "glosses": [
